1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,200
You said the last train left at midnight.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,800
It did. We just weren't on it.

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,000
[door slams]

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,600
JOHN: Then how did you get back
to the station?

5
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:10,700
I walked.

6
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:14,300
Six kilometres, in the rain, with a broken umbrella and your coat.

7
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,200
(sighs) Don't look at me like that.

8
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,900
# Night train, take me home #

9
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,400
{\an8}<i>Like what?</i>

10
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:23,600
Nothing.

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Été, café, déjà vu.
